# 🚀 Crypto Market Dashboard

A production-inspired **real-time cryptocurrency market dashboard** built with **Next.js, TypeScript, FastAPI, and WebSockets**.

The application streams live cryptocurrency market data from **Delta Exchange** through a centralized backend WebSocket service. Users authenticate using **Google OAuth**, receive a **JWT** for secure API access, and view real-time market updates without directly connecting to the exchange.

The project is designed with scalability and maintainability in mind by separating authentication, WebSocket communication, and frontend rendering into distinct layers.

---

# ✨ Features

## Authentication

* Google OAuth Sign-In
* JWT-based Authentication
* Protected Routes
* Secure User Sessions

## Real-Time Market Data

* Live cryptocurrency prices
* Backend WebSocket proxy
* Automatic reconnection handling
* Broadcast updates to all connected clients

## Dashboard

* Live market overview
* Responsive UI
* Real-time price updates
* Fast client-side rendering

## Backend

* REST APIs using FastAPI
* WebSocket server
* JWT authentication middleware
* Modular project architecture

## Deployment

* Dockerized application
* Frontend deployed on Vercel
* Backend deployed on Render

---

# 🏗️ System Architecture

                   Delta Exchange
                          │
                  WebSocket Connection
                          │
                 FastAPI Backend Server
                 ┌────────────────────┐
                 │  Authentication    │
                 │  REST APIs         │
                 │  WebSocket Manager │
                 └────────────────────┘
                          │
               Broadcast Live Updates
                          │
                    Next.js Frontend
                          │
                     Authenticated User

