# 🔐 Authentication Flow

User
   │
   ▼
Google OAuth
   │
   ▼
FastAPI verifies Google token
   │
   ▼
Generate JWT
   │
   ▼
Frontend stores JWT
   │
   ▼
Authenticated API Requests

---

# ⚡ Real-Time Data Flow

Delta Exchange
      │
      ▼
Single Backend WebSocket Connection
      │
      ▼
Process Incoming Messages
      │
      ▼
Broadcast to Connected Clients
      │
      ▼
Next.js Dashboard Updates Instantly

